  "17": {
   "id": 17,
   "text": "Pictures",
   "x": -151.29558190974254,
   "y": -817.8086876156199,
   "parent": 7,
   "color": "#f08c00",
   "order": 2,
   "img": {
    "src": "data:image/jpeg;base64,",
    "w": 360,
    "h": 240
   },
   "imgSize": "S",
   "notes": "<p>Add a picture with the <b>Picture</b> button, by pasting (<b>Ctrl+V</b>), or by dropping an image onto a bubble. Pick Small to X-Large next to the button.</p>"
  },
  "18": {
   "id": 18,
   "text": "Notes hold the long stuff",
   "x": -347.5713815299539,
   "y": -975.7556940303152,
   "parent": 7,
   "color": "#66a80f",
   "order": 3,
   "notes": "<h2>Everything a bubble can't hold</h2><p>Notes can be as long as you like, with <b>bold</b>, <i>italic</i>, <u>underline</u> and <s>strikethrough</s>.</p><ul><li>Bullet lists…<ul><li>…nested with Tab</li></ul></li></ul><ol><li>Numbered lists</li><li>For steps</li></ol><table><thead><tr><th>Add a…</th><th>How</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Table</td><td>Table… → Insert table</td></tr><tr><td>Picture</td><td>Picture button, paste or drop</td></tr><tr><td>Link</td><td>Link button or Ctrl+K</td></tr></tbody></table><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\"><blockquote><p>Quotes stand out.</p></blockquote><p>Web links work too: <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mind_map\">read about mind maps</a> (Ctrl+click to open).</p><hr><p>Notes are included when you export to Word or Markdown.</p>"
  },
  "19": {
   "id": 19,
   "text": "3 · Lines & links",
   "x": 860.0027079000633,
   "y": -449.5292884710184,
   "parent": null,
   "kind": "main",
   "color": "#2b2d42",
   "order": 2,
   "notes": "<h2>Lines</h2><p>Select a bubble and open the <b>Line</b> menu to change the line leading to it: <b>solid, dashed or dotted</b>, <b>arrows</b> at either end, and <b>thickness</b>. “Apply to whole branch” does a whole branch at once.</p><h2>Links</h2><p>Links join <b>any two bubbles</b>, even under different main ideas. Select a bubble, then <b>drag the link handle</b> in its bottom-left corner onto another bubble, or press <b>Link</b> and click the other bubble. Click a link to restyle it, or press <b>Delete</b> to remove it.</p>"
  },
