  },
  "25": {
   "id": 25,
   "text": "4 · Save, find & share",
   "x": 654.9208151626937,
   "y": 211.8052515236931,
   "parent": null,
   "kind": "main",
   "color": "#2b2d42",
   "order": 3,
   "notes": "<h3>Saving</h3><p>Diagrams save as <b>.spider</b> files: one file holds everything, pictures and notes included. Click the diagram's name at the top left to rename it.</p><h3>Your library</h3><p>The <b>home</b> button lists every diagram you have, with previews. Search finds words in titles, bubbles <i>and</i> notes.</p><h3>Sharing</h3><ul><li><b>Picture (PNG)</b>, light or dark, any size.</li><li><b>Word (.docx)</b>, which opens in Word or Google Docs: main ideas and branches become headings, and notes and links come along.</li><li><b>Markdown</b> or <b>plain text</b> outlines, and <b>Copy</b> for pasting into Google Docs.</li></ul>",
   "collapsed": true
  },
  "26": {
   "id": 26,
   "text": "Ctrl+S saves",
   "x": 654.9208151626937,
